# The PDF test fixture is written uncompressed, so most of its bytes are ASCII
# and git's auto-detection calls it text. Line-ending conversion would rewrite
# the byte offsets its xref table points at, and the file would stop parsing on
# any machine that checked it out.
*.pdf binary

# Screenshots. PNG is detected as binary reliably, but being explicit costs
# nothing and keeps every asset under one rule.
*.png binary
